OL,3,GNEWSATeens with braces 'abandoned' by
OL,4,Aorthodontist
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They've left so many people without a
OL,7,Fdentist and without any care," says
OL,8,FJacob, 16, who hoped his braces would
OL,9,Fbe coming off his teeth this summer.
OL,11,FHe is among more than 700 former
OL,12,Fpatients - both NHS and private - of
OL,13,FRiver Practice, an orthodontist in
OL,14,FCornwall that closed suddenly in April
OL,15,F2026 after the regional health body NHS
OL,16,FCornwall and Isles of Scilly Integrated
OL,17,FCare Board (ICB) found it was "no
OL,18,Flonger meeting the standards required",
OL,19,Fand terminated its contract.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
