OL,3,GNEWSATeens with braces 'abandoned' by
OL,4,Aorthodontist
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany patients, like Jacob, have been
OL,7,Fleft with braces but no treatment plan
OL,8,Fand some fear the devices could be
OL,9,Fdamaging their teeth and mouths.
OL,11,FThe practice owners have not responded
OL,12,Fto the BBC's requests for comment.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
